text = "[b]Bad at the game ey?
This is the perfect thing for you.

First off, you can drag this scroll to read things that are below.

...

...

...

You can also hold right click and drag it horizontally to change it's size.



Alright, these are your controls:

Movement
Jump: W or Space
Left: A
Right: D
Fast fall: S

Attacks
Skill 1: J or 1
Skill 2: K or 2
Skill 3: L or 3
Skill 4: I or 4
Skill 5: O or 5
Ultimate: U or 6

Misc
Inventory: Q
Interact: E
Console: Enter























































Dang you came all the way down here?
Well that deserves some sort of reward...

Uhhhh... I can tell you that you can scroll on the description area of the enemy guide to see their attacks...

Yeah that's kinda it.
[/b]"
